  number    =  3,
  pages     = "276--285",
  abstract  = "The prevalence of heart failure (HF) with preserved ejection
               fraction (HFpEF) is higher than that of HF with reduced/midrange
               ejection fraction (HFrEF/HFmrEF). However, no evidence-based
               guidelines for managing HFpEF have been generated. The current
