  journal  = "Science",
  abstract = "Heart size is controlled through an antagonistic interaction
              between Hippo and Wnt signaling pathways. Genetic regulation of
              mammalian heart size is poorly understood. Hippo signaling
              represents an organ-size control pathway in Drosophila, where it
