               4-((2-hydroxy-3-methoxybenzyl)amino)benzenesulfonamide
               derivatives as potent and selective inhibitors of 12-lipoxygenase",
  author    = "Luci, Diane K and Jameson, 2nd, J Brian and Yasgar, Adam and
