  author    = "Mann, Douglas L and McMurray, John J V and Packer, Milton and
               Swedberg, Karl and Borer, Jeffrey S and Colucci, Wilson S and
               Djian, Jacques and Drexler, Helmut and Feldman, Arthur and Kober,
