              zebraﬁsh can regenerate their hearts via cardiomyocyte
              de-differentiation and proliferation. However, a molecular
              mechanism of why these cardiomyocytes can re-enter cell cycle is
              poorly understood. Here, we identify a unique metabolic state that
              primes adult zebraﬁsh and neonatal mouse ventricular
