              pathophysiology biomarkers (93\%) and novel proteins (7\%).
              Longitudinal assessment revealed that HFrEF and HFpEF PRSs were
              higher and increased more over time in individuals who experienced
              a fatal event during follow-up. CONCLUSIONS: PRSs can provide
