  journal  = "J. Mol. Cell. Cardiol.",
  volume   =  160,
  pages    = "73--86",
  abstract = "The temporal nature of chromatin structural changes underpinning
              pathologic transcription are poorly understood. We measured
              chromatin accessibility and DNA methylation to study the
              contribution of chromatin remodeling at different stages of
              cardiac hypertrophy and failure. ATAC-seq and reduced
